    "Supports common network and CSS hiding filters. Scriptlets, procedural filters, redirects, regular expressions, and complex domain exceptions are skipped. This is not full uBlock Origin compatibility.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports common network and CSS hiding filters. Scriptlets, procedural filters, redirects, regular expressions, and complex domain exceptions are skipped. This is not full uBlock Origin compatibility."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持常见网络过滤和 CSS 元素隐藏规则。脚本片段、过程式过滤、重定向、正则表达式和复杂域名例外会跳过，不完全兼容 uBlock Origin。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支援常見網路篩選與 CSS 元素隱藏規則。腳本片段、程序式篩選、重新導向、正規表示式及複雜網域例外會略過，並非完整相容 uBlock Origin。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一般的なネットワークと CSS 非表示フィルターに対応。スクリプトレット、手続き型フィルター、リダイレクト、正規表現、複雑なドメイン例外はスキップされます。uBlock Origin との完全互換ではありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "일반 네트워크 및 CSS 숨김 필터를 지원합니다. 스크립틀릿, 절차적 필터, 리디렉션, 정규식 및 복잡한 도메인 예외는 건너뜁니다. uBlock Origin과 완전히 호환되지는 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filtres réseau et masquage CSS courants pris en charge. Scriptlets, filtres procéduraux, redirections, expressions régulières et exceptions de domaine complexes sont ignorés. Compatibilité uBlock Origin partielle."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Übliche Netzwerk- und CSS-Ausblendefilter werden unterstützt. Scriptlets, prozedurale Filter, Umleitungen, reguläre Ausdrücke und komplexe Domainausnahmen werden übersprungen. Keine vollständige uBlock-Origin-Kompatibilität."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Admite filtros comunes de red y ocultación CSS. Omite scriptlets, filtros procedimentales, redirecciones, expresiones regulares y excepciones de dominio complejas. La compatibilidad con uBlock Origin es parcial."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suporta filtros comuns de rede e ocultação CSS. Scriptlets, filtros procedurais, redirecionamentos, expressões regulares e exceções complexas de domínio são ignorados. Compatibilidade parcial com uBlock Origin."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supporta filtri di rete e mascheramento CSS comuni. Scriptlet, filtri procedurali, reindirizzamenti, espressioni regolari ed eccezioni di dominio complesse vengono ignorati. Compatibilità uBlock Origin parziale."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ondersteunt gangbare netwerk- en CSS-verbergfilters. Scriptlets, procedurele filters, omleidingen, reguliere expressies en complexe domeinuitzonderingen worden overgeslagen. Geen volledige uBlock Origin-compatibiliteit."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Поддерживаются обычные сетевые и CSS-фильтры скрытия. Скриптлеты, процедурные фильтры, перенаправления, регулярные выражения и сложные исключения доменов пропускаются. Совместимость с uBlock Origin неполная."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يدعم مرشحات الشبكة وإخفاء CSS الشائعة. يتم تخطي السكربتات المصغرة والمرشحات الإجرائية وإعادة التوجيه والتعبيرات النمطية واستثناءات النطاق المعقدة. التوافق مع uBlock Origin جزئي."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "รองรับตัวกรองเครือข่ายและการซ่อน CSS ทั่วไป ข้ามสคริปต์เล็ต ตัวกรองเชิงกระบวนการ การเปลี่ยนเส้นทาง นิพจน์ทั่วไป และข้อยกเว้นโดเมนที่ซับซ้อน ไม่รองรับ uBlock Origin อย่างสมบูรณ์"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mendukung filter jaringan dan penyembunyian CSS umum. Scriptlet, filter prosedural, pengalihan, ekspresi reguler, dan pengecualian domain kompleks dilewati. Kompatibilitas uBlock Origin tidak penuh."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hỗ trợ bộ lọc mạng và ẩn CSS phổ biến. Bỏ qua scriptlet, bộ lọc thủ tục, chuyển hướng, biểu thức chính quy và ngoại lệ tên miền phức tạp. Không tương thích đầy đủ uBlock Origin."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yaygın ağ ve CSS gizleme filtrelerini destekler. Scriptlet, işlemsel filtreler, yönlendirmeler, düzenli ifadeler ve karmaşık alan adı istisnaları atlanır. Tam uBlock Origin uyumluluğu yoktur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
